## Decisions, dependencies and remaining evidence

Product semantics above are selected, not a menu delegated to builder. Remaining
implementation checks are actual declaration validity/retention reservations,
unused explicit cohort labels, journal successor integration and final facade/MCP
schema reconciliation with independent Draft2 review. If a selected form is not
expressible by current common declarations, report the exact constraint before
adding an interpreter feature. Do not implement it secretly in a coordinator.

The full durable-cloud-workspace/browser/device stories and complete manual
remain separate open project duties. A local counting runner does not provide
durable cloud repository processes, key recovery after losing all devices or
proposal review/landing. The durability request578 retains honest recorded-do
versus volatile behavior; commitments here are recorded-do, not live presence.

Acceptance is complete only after the reviewed source lands, native enrollment
and counting cohort work end to end, independent clients execute real sound,
one remotely located agent participates through the same authorized interface,
and the natural hosted demonstration/replay/recovery is recorded with limits.
No such result follows from this planning note.
